  exerciseNumber: 08
  exerciseName: CraftingGoldIngotWithOneOre
  exerciseTitle: Crafting Gold ingot with one ore
  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63458731
  exerciseText: It's crafting Gold Ingot even with just one Gold Ore
  hintText: Is the Has Item List logic working fine? It seems to not be testing for
    duplicates.
  solutionText: "The Hast Item List logic is only testing if the item exist and not
    testing for duplicates. If there's just one of the type then it is considered
    to have all of them.\nforeach (ItemSO itemSO in testItemSOList) {\r\n    if (!cloneItemSOList.Contains(itemSO))
    {\r\n        // Does not contain\r\n        return false;\r\n    } else {\r\n       
    cloneItemSOList.Remove(itemSO);\r\n    }\r\n}"
